{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:55487f1a62587660","name":"Believer Disciple Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-55487f1a62587660","title":"Believer Disciple Talent Tree","revision":16197,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:29Z","sha256":"89489d04ca735c6313ca6a3a555f20960529760805e904028bda2b60484c5be1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16197","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Believer%20Disciple%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-55487f1a62587660","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Believers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Believers","referenceId":"reference:e44a419b610a5e71"}," follow the teachings of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," from ancient times and strive to extend the influence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Believers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Believers","referenceId":"reference:e44a419b610a5e71"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Believer Intuition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", when an opponent successfully attacks you, make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and compare the result to your opponent's attack roll. If the check equals or exceeds the result of the attack roll, you can add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defense Boost"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. If the check succeeds, you gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," until the end of the encounter. Before you make your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, you can increase the target number to DC 20 to gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to all your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hardiness"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to reduce the number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," it takes you to move +1 step along to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by one.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["High Impact"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. If your check succeeds, double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus to the next melee damage roll you make before the end of your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sith Reverence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +1 morale bonus on your attack rolls while you are within 20 squares and in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," of an ally with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," equal to or greater than your own.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
